WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:03.767
-"Fox News" and the GOP
have been struggling

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:06.234
to criticize President Biden's
coronavirus response,

00:00:06.234 --> 00:00:08.634
including his $1.9 trillion
relief bill,

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:11.367
because it's been overwhelmingly
popular with voters.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:12.868
So now they're insisting

00:00:12.868 --> 00:00:14.801
he give his predecessor
credit for the vaccine.

00:00:14.801 --> 00:00:17.501
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:21.367 --> 00:00:22.868
It's an awkward time
for "Fox News,"

00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:25.968
arguably their biggest star
wasn't any of their anchors,

00:00:25.968 --> 00:00:27.734
but the 45th president himself.

00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:31.234
The guy called into Fox News
more often than a Mets fan

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:32.901
calling into a sports radio show

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:34.534
to complain
about the off season.

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.567
[ As fan ] Look, I know we have
a new billionaire owner

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:39.100
that we signed ten free agents
and made seven trades,

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.067
but do we really think orange
and blue looked good together?

00:00:42.067 --> 00:00:44.100
I'll hang up and listen.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.100
[ Normal voice ] The point is,
Trump was Fox's big star

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.300
in defending him was
their number one mission.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.100
Now, without that,
they're a little at sea.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.667
They've spent the past few weeks
in full meltdown mode

00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:54.767
over everything from
"The Muppets" to "Dr. Seuss"

00:00:54.767 --> 00:00:56.501
to "Mr. Potato Head,"
to the "Looney Tunes,"

00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:58.801
to Joy Bahar,
to the Grammys,

00:00:58.801 --> 00:01:01.701
to defending Piers Morgan
after he stormed off

00:01:01.701 --> 00:01:04.734
the set of his own show
like a guest on "Maury"

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:07.901
who won't accept the results
of a paternity test.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.567
They can't defend Trump
and they can't effectively

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:11.200
criticize Biden.
So they've been lurching

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:13.601
from one dumb culture war issue
to the next.

00:01:13.601 --> 00:01:16.868
They know Biden's COVID response
has been overwhelmingly popular

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:18.334
and the COVID relief bill

00:01:18.334 --> 00:01:20.601
has even been popular
with Republican voters.

00:01:20.601 --> 00:01:23.267
Fifty nine percent of whom say
they support the COVID bill.

00:01:23.267 --> 00:01:27.501
So remember that when people say
it's not bipartisan, it is.

00:01:27.501 --> 00:01:31.300
It's just that no Republican
politician supported it.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.934
Also, let me just say
as a side note,

00:01:33.934 --> 00:01:36.667
no one gives [Bleep]
if it's bipartisan,

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:39.601
people care much more about
results than bipartisanship.

00:01:39.601 --> 00:01:41.634
Polls have borne
that out repeatedly.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.634
Do you think a family of four
would have been happier

00:01:43.634 --> 00:01:45.167
if instead of $12,000

00:01:45.167 --> 00:01:46.868
in stimulus money
and child benefits,

00:01:46.868 --> 00:01:50.300
they got a much crappier bill
that had Republican support?

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.267
[ As spouse 1 ] Well, honey,
our unemployment benefits

00:01:52.267 --> 00:01:53.834
are expiring a month earlier

00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:57.801
and it's only a $600 check,
but Susan Collins voted for it.

00:01:57.801 --> 00:02:01.000
[As spouse 2] We got Collins?
[As spouse 1]We got Collins!

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:04.467
well off
to work a triple shift.

00:02:04.467 --> 00:02:06.834
In fact, even when "Fox News"
does try to latch on

00:02:06.834 --> 00:02:09.133
to something Biden said,
they melt down

00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:10.767
over the most insignificant
bull[Bleep]

00:02:10.767 --> 00:02:12.000
because it's all they have.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:13.434
For example, they obsessed
over the fact that

00:02:13.434 --> 00:02:15.667
in his prime time address
last week,

00:02:15.667 --> 00:02:18.767
Biden suggested that
if we keep wearing masks

00:02:18.767 --> 00:02:20.934
and get as many people
vaccinated as possible,

00:02:20.934 --> 00:02:24.434
we might be able to safely
have July 4th barbecues

00:02:24.434 --> 00:02:25.834
with friends
and families this year.

00:02:25.834 --> 00:02:28.734
And in response,
Fox pundits lost their mind.

00:02:28.734 --> 00:02:30.634
-The message that Joe Biden
was sending

00:02:30.634 --> 00:02:33.200
to the American people
was a lecture.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:36.634
It was a demand that basically
said you'll only be able

00:02:36.634 --> 00:02:38.968
to have a 4th of July
if you go along

00:02:38.968 --> 00:02:41.701
with all the different things
that I say you have to do.

00:02:41.701 --> 00:02:45.501
-We might be getting back to
normal around the Fourth of July

00:02:45.501 --> 00:02:47.601
if only we all behave.

00:02:47.601 --> 00:02:49.000
-Well, I hate
to tell Joe Biden,

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.634
but nobody needs his permission

00:02:50.634 --> 00:02:52.701
to gather in our backyards
on the Fourth of July

00:02:52.701 --> 00:02:55.167
or any holiday or any day,
for that matter.

00:02:55.167 --> 00:02:58.467
-He's got no say in who's
coming to my picnic or yours.

00:02:58.467 --> 00:03:01.133
-He does not have
my permission

00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:03.000
to give me permission.
-Right.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.000
-About who I can have
a barbecue with.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.734
-Yes. This is a free people.
This is a free country.

00:03:07.734 --> 00:03:10.701
How dare you tell us who we can
spend the Fourth of July with.

00:03:10.701 --> 00:03:13.968
-To pick Independence Day
as the day where he says

00:03:13.968 --> 00:03:18.133
he might allow people to gather
is just so un-American.

00:03:18.133 --> 00:03:22.334
And, and just, you know,
Joe Biden doesn't get to tell me

00:03:22.334 --> 00:03:25.534
when I can have a barbecue
in my backyard.

00:03:25.534 --> 00:03:26.667
-He's not!

00:03:26.667 --> 00:03:29.033
You're all free
to do whatever you want

00:03:29.033 --> 00:03:31.133
with whoever you want
in your backyard.

00:03:31.133 --> 00:03:33.100
I invite all of you to go
to Tucker's house

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:36.167
for a barbecue where I'm sure
he puts out Coors Light

00:03:36.167 --> 00:03:38.601
and then drinks the Sam Adams
you brought.

00:03:38.601 --> 00:03:40.567
Sane people knew
what Biden was saying.

00:03:40.567 --> 00:03:42.400
Most people have been following
public health advice

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:45.000
because they don't want to get
their friends and family sick

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.133
and vice versa.
But if we all do our part,

00:03:47.133 --> 00:03:49.400
we can safely gather again
this summer.

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:52.567
It wasn't a directive.
It wasn't a mandate.

00:03:52.567 --> 00:03:55.968
It wasn't an executive order.
It was just a suggestion

00:03:55.968 --> 00:03:58.567
like you should wear a helmet
on your motorcycle

00:03:58.567 --> 00:04:00.400
or don't eat raw chicken.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:03.133
But over at "Fox News,"
whose slogan might as well be

00:04:03.133 --> 00:04:07.234
"We run with scissors," they're
so desperate to play the victim,

00:04:07.234 --> 00:04:08.901
they'll take even
the mildest suggestion

00:04:08.901 --> 00:04:10.934
and try to turn it into
a don't tread on me moment.

00:04:10.934 --> 00:04:13.701
We all know the type,
the people who fall apart

00:04:13.701 --> 00:04:16.033
when they see
no substitutions on a menu.

00:04:16.033 --> 00:04:18.734
[ Whiny voice ] Oh, but I had my
heart set on a BLP --

00:04:18.734 --> 00:04:20.801
bacon, lettuce, and potato.

00:04:20.801 --> 00:04:22.133
[ Normal voice ] Now it will
shock you to learn

00:04:22.133 --> 00:04:24.767
that this criticism of Biden
has not stuck either.

00:04:24.767 --> 00:04:27.033
So now they're on
to another line,

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:29.734
slamming him for not giving
Trump credit for the vaccines.

00:04:29.734 --> 00:04:32.434
-The Biden administration
continues to refuse to share

00:04:32.434 --> 00:04:34.234
any credit
on vaccine development

00:04:34.234 --> 00:04:35.868
with former President Trump.

00:04:35.868 --> 00:04:37.367
-President Biden did not utter

00:04:37.367 --> 00:04:40.567
President Trump's name once
during his first solo address.

00:04:40.567 --> 00:04:43.033
He didn't give President Trump
any credit, even though

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:45.434
President Trump
rolled back regulations

00:04:45.434 --> 00:04:47.534
and, of course,
introduced Warp Speed

00:04:47.534 --> 00:04:49.300
to get those vaccines
on the market.

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:50.934
-I loved how he took credit
for what

00:04:50.934 --> 00:04:54.000
President Trump has been doing
as far as the vaccine

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.701
and getting it roll it out.
But no one called him out on it.

00:04:56.701 --> 00:05:00.734
-No Trump, no vaccine, Joe, stop
taking credit for something,

00:05:00.734 --> 00:05:02.367
frankly,
you had nothing to do with.

00:05:02.367 --> 00:05:04.267
He could talk about
operation warp speed,

00:05:04.267 --> 00:05:05.934
how we exceeded expectations.

00:05:05.934 --> 00:05:09.033
And we don't need to go over
the 500,000 dead.

00:05:09.033 --> 00:05:10.367
We had that moment.

00:05:10.367 --> 00:05:13.167
Let's talk about
the future moving forward.

00:05:13.167 --> 00:05:14.267
Every time he has a chance

00:05:14.267 --> 00:05:16.033
to praise
the previous administration,

00:05:16.033 --> 00:05:19.734
he not only doesn't praise,
he kicks him in the groin.

00:05:19.734 --> 00:05:21.868
-I mean, first of all,
Biden doesn't need to kick

00:05:21.868 --> 00:05:24.567
Trump in the groin
because he already looks like

00:05:24.567 --> 00:05:25.801
he just got kicked in the groin.

00:05:25.801 --> 00:05:27.300
He leans forward
like he just took

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.000
a tennis ball
in the nut[Bleep].

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.801
The ball machine's
on the lowest setting.

00:05:30.801 --> 00:05:33.300
He didn't even move his racket.

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:34.767
Sometimes he looked like
he's about

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:36.834
to get kicked in the groin,
like when he sits with his legs

00:05:36.834 --> 00:05:38.734
spread far apart,
like he's in an episode

00:05:38.734 --> 00:05:40.968
of "Jackass" bracing for
a game of nutball.

00:05:40.968 --> 00:05:44.000
Let's not, let's just not gloss
over it.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:47.033
The heartless,
sociopathic dismissal

00:05:47.033 --> 00:05:49.367
of the fact that over half
a million people died.

00:05:49.367 --> 00:05:51.767
You're talking about a
once-in-a-century catastrophe

00:05:51.767 --> 00:05:53.133
full of misery and death,

00:05:53.133 --> 00:05:56.100
like the taskmaster
at the weekly book club.

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:58.167
Okay, Barbara, we don't need
to go over, "Eat, Pray, Love,"

00:05:58.167 --> 00:05:59.567
that was last week.

00:05:59.567 --> 00:06:01.801
Let's talk about this week's
book, "Green Eggs and Ham."

00:06:01.801 --> 00:06:03.667
[ Whispering ] It's just the
cover of "Green Eggs and Ham"

00:06:03.667 --> 00:06:06.367
the inside is
"McElligot's Pool."

00:06:06.367 --> 00:06:08.734
And not only do Fox hosts want
Biden to give Trump

00:06:08.734 --> 00:06:10.234
credit publicly,
they also want him

00:06:10.234 --> 00:06:12.667
to call Trump personally
to thank him.

00:06:12.667 --> 00:06:15.133
-Joe Biden, he needs
to pick up the phone,

00:06:15.133 --> 00:06:18.334
I suggest call
Mar a Lago and yeah,

00:06:18.334 --> 00:06:21.834
bring unity to the country as
he says he so desperately wants.

00:06:21.834 --> 00:06:24.567
And thank
President Donald Trump.

00:06:24.567 --> 00:06:27.334
-Is it Mara Largo?
[ Laughs ]

00:06:27.334 --> 00:06:29.434
I guess I've been saying
it wrong.

00:06:29.434 --> 00:06:32.934
So tune in for Sean Hannity's
correction this week.

00:06:32.934 --> 00:06:35.501
Oh, really? You think
you should call Mar a Lago?

00:06:35.501 --> 00:06:37.334
First of all,
have you seen Trump lately?

00:06:37.334 --> 00:06:38.734
I doubt you have to call him.

00:06:38.734 --> 00:06:40.801
He looks so ghostly you can
probably use a Ouija board.

00:06:40.801 --> 00:06:42.467
He looks like he's haunting
the golf course.

00:06:42.467 --> 00:06:45.100
The "Legend of Haggard Vance,"
[ As Trump ] "You summoned me?"

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:46.133
[ Normal voice ]
Yeah, Don, Listen.

00:06:46.133 --> 00:06:47.300
[ As Trump ] Can I get
a diet Coke?

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.467
[ Normal voice ] Sure.
I just wanted to --

00:06:48.467 --> 00:06:49.501
[ As Trump ] Mind if I crash
here tonight?

00:06:49.501 --> 00:06:50.567
Mel doesn't want me around.

00:06:50.567 --> 00:06:51.601
Says it keeps
giving her the creeps

00:06:51.601 --> 00:06:52.934
by passing through walls.

00:06:52.934 --> 00:06:54.634
[ Normal voice ] Although there
seems to be some tension

00:06:54.634 --> 00:06:57.434
at Fox over whether Trump
deserves credit

00:06:57.434 --> 00:06:59.200
for this miraculous
medical breakthrough

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:02.167
that will save the world
or whether the vaccines

00:07:02.167 --> 00:07:06.267
are actually part of a sinister
plot to do something bad.

00:07:06.267 --> 00:07:08.067
It's not clear what,
but don't worry.

00:07:08.067 --> 00:07:10.467
Human Catamaran Tucker Carlson
is on the case.

00:07:10.467 --> 00:07:14.734
-How effective is this
coronavirus vaccine?

00:07:14.734 --> 00:07:18.200
How necessary is it
to take the vaccine?

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:21.667
Don't dismiss those questions
from anti-vaxxers,

00:07:21.667 --> 00:07:24.334
don't kick people off
social media for asking them,

00:07:24.334 --> 00:07:25.834
answer the questions.

00:07:25.834 --> 00:07:27.968
-How effective is
this vaccine?

00:07:27.968 --> 00:07:31.067
How necessary is it
to take the vaccine?

00:07:31.067 --> 00:07:34.734
Will it make you an X man?
Or what about an Animorph?

00:07:34.734 --> 00:07:37.067
Will it make me half man,
half porcupine?

00:07:37.067 --> 00:07:38.801
And if I go to the mall
with my children

00:07:38.801 --> 00:07:41.501
after taking the vaccine
and I get spooked

00:07:41.501 --> 00:07:43.834
by one of the mannequins
at the Tommy Bahama store

00:07:43.834 --> 00:07:46.734
and shoot my quills
at a security guard,

00:07:46.734 --> 00:07:49.200
will they throw me out?
Will my children laugh at me?

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:51.601
What if I say it's because
the vaccine turned me

00:07:51.601 --> 00:07:53.000
into a porky man

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.300
and they say, "Sir, you didn't
shoot quills at anyone.

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:57.467
You urinated on
the chambray beach shorts."

00:07:57.467 --> 00:08:01.200
And I say, "Oh, so now I can't
urinate wherever I want.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:04.901
I thought this was America and I
thought America was number one."

00:08:04.901 --> 00:08:06.767
And then I urinate again

00:08:06.767 --> 00:08:11.334
because the vaccine also
took away my bladder control.

00:08:11.334 --> 00:08:13.601
All these questions
have already been answered.

00:08:13.601 --> 00:08:15.133
You could save yourself
the trouble of writing

00:08:15.133 --> 00:08:17.067
your nightly monologue
by just using Google,

00:08:17.067 --> 00:08:18.901
although maybe
he doesn't know how,

00:08:18.901 --> 00:08:21.934
that would explain why he always
looks like Templeton the Rat

00:08:21.934 --> 00:08:24.467
trying to read Charlotte's Web.

00:08:24.467 --> 00:08:28.334
Some pig? What kind of pig
are we talking about?

00:08:28.334 --> 00:08:32.534
A wild boar or just
a standard farm pig?

00:08:32.534 --> 00:08:34.901
I'm just asking questions.

00:08:34.901 --> 00:08:37.634
The trial data, which was
reviewed extensively

00:08:37.634 --> 00:08:39.067
by public health officials,

00:08:39.067 --> 00:08:41.501
have shown all three vaccines
to be highly safe and effective,

00:08:41.501 --> 00:08:44.234
especially against severe
disease and hospitalization.

00:08:44.234 --> 00:08:46.601
And there's still more
real world data

00:08:46.601 --> 00:08:48.033
coming in all the time.

00:08:48.033 --> 00:08:50.567
New studies testing the efficacy
of the vaccines on variants

00:08:50.567 --> 00:08:52.334
or in specific settings
like nursing homes

00:08:52.334 --> 00:08:55.067
and suggesting they could
even be highly effective

00:08:55.067 --> 00:08:56.634
at stopping transmission
as well.

00:08:56.634 --> 00:08:58.200
And it's necessary to take
the vaccine

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:00.200
if, say,
you're not Tucker Carlson

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:01.868
and you can't do
your cushy TV job

00:09:01.868 --> 00:09:03.667
from the safety
of your studio bubble,

00:09:03.667 --> 00:09:06.434
where I'm certain no one's
allowed within six feet of you,

00:09:06.434 --> 00:09:07.801
even when there isn't
a pandemic,

00:09:07.801 --> 00:09:09.767
because they might accidentally
make eye contact

00:09:09.767 --> 00:09:11.067
and have their soul devoured.

00:09:11.067 --> 00:09:12.834
Some people actually
have to go out into the world

00:09:12.834 --> 00:09:14.067
and do real jobs for a living,

00:09:14.067 --> 00:09:15.701
where they're forced to interact
with other people,

00:09:15.701 --> 00:09:18.033
which puts them at risk.
And they don't have the luxury

00:09:18.033 --> 00:09:19.801
of getting the same
high end medical care

00:09:19.801 --> 00:09:22.200
that, say, Donald Trump got
when he got COVID.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:24.934
And I say that
as a fellow TV show host

00:09:24.934 --> 00:09:27.133
who is constantly tested
for COVID,

00:09:27.133 --> 00:09:29.934
this job is easy compared
to most people's jobs.

00:09:29.934 --> 00:09:31.701
How about you try working
in a meatpacking plant

00:09:31.701 --> 00:09:33.667
or a nursing home or
a public school for a few days?

00:09:33.667 --> 00:09:36.033
The hardest thing I ever
have to do is tell Wally

00:09:36.033 --> 00:09:38.300
he doesn't have any lines
in tonight's show.

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.801
-I just bought a new car, Seth,
I really need to check.

00:09:40.801 --> 00:09:42.567
-Hey, hey, hey.
What did I say, Wally?

00:09:42.567 --> 00:09:44.267
That doesn't count, does it?
It does?!

00:09:44.267 --> 00:09:46.834
[ Groans ]

00:09:46.834 --> 00:09:49.267
Also, we need as many people
as possible to get vaccinated

00:09:49.267 --> 00:09:50.801
so we can reach herd immunity,

00:09:50.801 --> 00:09:53.701
get to the point where the virus
isn't just freely circulating

00:09:53.701 --> 00:09:55.100
and sparking constant
outbreaks,

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:58.033
which would allow us to get back
to our normal lives safely.

00:09:58.033 --> 00:10:00.200
Even Donald Trump
told his supporters on Fox News

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.567
last night
to get the vaccine,

00:10:01.567 --> 00:10:05.033
although, of course, he was also
desperate to claim credit,

00:10:05.033 --> 00:10:08.634
especially after being egged on
by UNcancel Looney Tune

00:10:08.634 --> 00:10:09.801
Maria Bartiromo.

00:10:09.801 --> 00:10:12.467
-How are you feeling tonight
about the fact

00:10:12.467 --> 00:10:15.067
that you're not getting
